I'll go with the timeout, commented as "defer so the mount render settles first". Actually, simpler and more idiomatic: since this is a reviewer tool, add an explicit "Load" state? No.

Let me use `queueMicrotask`? The rule may still trace. `setTimeout` is the safest.

